{"2700370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vector Bias", "steam_appid": 2700370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the ruins of a devastated Earth, take the controls of an advanced mecha, a Vector, in a desperate last-ditch effort to save the planet. Shoot your way through randomly generated environments, from Earth to orbit. Obtain upgrades along the way and destroy the enemies and bosses that try to stop you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.poster.avif?t=1784373056\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.webm?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.mp4?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAILURE IS NOT THE END</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being shot down, your Vector can be repaired and enhanced for another attempt. Every run is unique, the path you choose as you speed through various procedurally generated environments will determine the foes and conditions you face and the rewards you gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.poster.avif?t=1784373056\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.webm?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.mp4?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR VECTOR </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parts and data gained in each attempt to unlock new weapons and permanently upgrade your Vectors capabilities for a unique loadout and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY THE ENEMY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fixed defenses, fight relentless flying mechanical enemies and battle giant multi-stage bosses in epic aerial battles.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the ruins of a devastated Earth, take the controls of an advanced mecha, a Vector, in a desperate last-ditch effort to save the planet. Shoot your way through randomly generated environments, from Earth to orbit. Obtain upgrades along the way and destroy the enemies and bosses that try to stop you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.poster.avif?t=1784373056\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.webm?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/f82877dae64fb40d2e3aa2ac13fa637b.mp4?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAILURE IS NOT THE END</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being shot down, your Vector can be repaired and enhanced for another attempt. Every run is unique, the path you choose as you speed through various procedurally generated environments will determine the foes and conditions you face and the rewards you gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.poster.avif?t=1784373056\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.webm?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/extras/75b1f65b78ed3ef51e515731f8104829.mp4?t=1784373056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR VECTOR </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parts and data gained in each attempt to unlock new weapons and permanently upgrade your Vectors capabilities for a unique loadout and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTROY THE ENEMY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fixed defenses, fight relentless flying mechanical enemies and battle giant multi-stage bosses in epic aerial battles.</p>", "short_description": "Vector Bias is a mecha anime inspired rogue-like. Pilot a custom Vector(mecha) and engage in fast-paced aerial combat against flying mechanical enemies, evade entrenched defenses and battle giant bosses.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/af0463f793e379507efa3d18b1dc1bb9cb6ef4ce/header.jpg?t=1784373056", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784373056", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784373056", "website": null, "p